OL,3,GNEWSAHenry VIII castle attraction takes
OL,4,Astep forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FHull City Council remains "fully
OL,7,Fcommitted" to plans for a long-delayed
OL,8,Fvisitor attraction on the site of a
OL,9,FTudor castle, its leader has said.
OL,11,FThe South Blockhouse was built on the
OL,12,Forders of Henry VIII between 1541 and
OL,13,F1543 to protect the port, but was
OL,14,Fdemolished in the 19th Century.
OL,16,FSurvey work has now started on the site
OL,17,Fof the proposed attraction, which was
OL,18,Foriginally due to be completed in 2025
OL,19,Fbut suffered from a funding shortfall.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
