OL,3,GNEWSAHenry VIII castle attraction takes
OL,4,Astep forward
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil leader Mike Ross said: "The
OL,7,Fcouncil remains fully committed to
OL,8,Fdelivering this project and ensuring
OL,9,Fthis remarkable, and largely untold,
OL,10,Fchapter of the city's history can be
OL,11,Fshared with future generations."
